entrega e atendimento a qualquer momento.', 42.9, 24.9, NULL, 'Home & Living > Bathrooms > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820lh-mnacaxq9juv6d1', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F337531568%2F16172439254', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
