ados que as valorizam em todos os aspectos.', 175.9, 69.9, NULL, 'Women Shoes > Heels', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-lt5qauwmha9r52', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F323760756%2F22292930352', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
