MS CADA) 4OHMS MONTADORA', 137.29, 122.19, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-ma1mqd30m6ntde', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F328179142%2F40951728691', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
